**Debouncing** — delay the action until activity stops. Fires once after a pause.

```js
const debounce = (fn, ms) => {
  let t;
  return (...args) => {
    clearTimeout(t);
    t = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), ms);
  };
};
```

**Throttling** — limit the action to once per interval. Fires at a steady max rate.

```js
const throttle = (fn, ms) => {
  let last = 0;
  return (...args) => {
    const now = Date.now();
    if (now - last >= ms) {
      last = now;
      fn(...args);
    }
  };
};
```

**Use debounce for:** search-as-you-type, resize-end, autosave.
**Use throttle for:** scroll, mousemove, keydown (rapid repeated events).

